rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes


[TR5's Exercise 4-6 (Symbolic, output equivalent)]

ei,3,0,vs
rf,3,2,rf
ro,2,t,ro
ed,2,0,μ*vrf

analysis: dc
note: Second half: find the Thévenin equivalent seen by the load, between t and 0 — vth = vs*μ/(μ+1) and req = ro, matching the textbook.
image: https://learn.symbulator.com/assets/practice/tr5s-exercise-4-6-symbolic-35.jpg
tool: th
n1: t
n2: 0
rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes


